                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "A Badge With Soup\nStains",
                                  "The old badge has\na square seal and\na repaired pin.\nIts owner",
                                  "scratched a list\ninside: Ask.\nMeasure. Carry a\nspare. Eat lunch.\nThe",
                                  "final instruction\nwas added more\ndeeply than the\nothers, perhaps",
                                  "after someone\nlearned its\nimportance."
                                ],
